    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EFX · Canary (every 15 min, **inactive by default**)\nCalls `n8n_ping` through the Router and asserts the effective environment: `env === '<<EXPECTED_ENV>>'` (TEST|DEV|STAGING|PROD) **and** `spreadsheetId === '<<EXPECTED_SHEET_ID>>'` (the sheet this tier must write to — catches the Script-Properties/config-resolution trap).\nTransport/script failures (error output of the Router call) alert too.\n\nWhy not `callerSession`? Through the Execution API the script runs **as the impersonated user** (`efx-bot@team-group.com`), so `callerSession` is `authenticated`, not `anonymous` — it is informational only and included in the alert body.\nAlert → Gmail to dbinns@team-group.com, subject `[EFX canary] …`. Replace placeholders, pick the Router id, then activate. Point *Settings → Error workflow* at the global handler as well.",
        "width": 1040,
        "height": 330,
        "color": 4
      },
